---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/privacy.css";

const privacyContact = "happyedizioni@gmail.com";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Cookie Policy | Boscofuso"
  description="Privacy and cookie information for the Boscofuso website."
  lang="en"
  robots="noindex,follow"
>
  <section class="privacy-page">
    <div class="privacy-page__container">
      <header class="privacy-page__header">
        <p class="privacy-page__eyebrow">Boscofuso · Happy Edy</p>
        <h1>Privacy & Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-page__updated">Last updated: 13 August 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          The website <strong>boscofuso.com</strong> is dedicated to the independent
          <strong>Happy Edy</strong> publishing project and to the fictional world of Boscofuso.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Privacy contact:</strong> {privacyContact}
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>2. Data processed</h2>

        <div class="privacy-page__subsection">
          <h3>Browsing data</h3>
          <p>
            When you visit the website, the technical systems required to operate it may
            automatically process information such as your IP address, date and time of the request,
            requested page, browser and device type, network information and technical data used for
            security and proper delivery of the website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-page__subsection">
          <h3>Data provided voluntarily</h3>
          <p>
            The current Boscofuso source code does not contain contact forms, account registration,
            restricted areas or newsletter forms. The website therefore does not directly collect,
            through its own forms, names, email addresses or other information voluntarily entered
            by visitors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-page__subsection">
          <h3>Children’s data</h3>
          <p>
            Boscofuso includes content suitable for younger audiences, but the website does not
            require children to register and is not designed to knowingly collect personal data from
            children through forms, profiles or profiling tools.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>3. Purposes and legal bases</h2>
        <p>Technical data may be processed in order to:</p>
        <ul class="privacy-page__list">
          <li>deliver the website and its content;</li>
          <li>ensure security, stability and prevention of abuse or attacks;</li>
          <li>diagnose technical errors and service issues;</li>
          <li>comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Depending on the circumstances, the legal basis is the legitimate interest in operating
          and securing the website and compliance with legal obligations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>4. Hosting and Cloudflare</h2>
        <p>
          The website is published using Cloudflare services. In providing infrastructure, content
          delivery and security functions, Cloudflare may process technical data relating to user
          requests, including IP addresses and network traffic information.
        </p>
        <p>
          Certain Cloudflare security functions may also use strictly necessary technical cookies or
          equivalent technologies. Their presence depends on the services and security measures
          actually enabled for the domain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>5. Google Fonts</h2>
        <p>
          The website currently uses Google Fonts to load the “Baloo 2” typeface. Your browser
          therefore makes a request to Google servers to obtain the stylesheet and font files; this
          request may transmit technical information to Google, including your IP address and browser
          information.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google processes this information according to its own terms and privacy information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>6. Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
        <p>
          The current website source code does not contain advertising tools, profiling cookies,
          marketing pixels or analytics systems installed by the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Strictly necessary technical cookies or equivalent technologies may nevertheless be used
          for infrastructure operation and security, for example in connection with specific
          Cloudflare functions. Technical cookies used solely for strictly necessary purposes do not
          require prior consent under the applicable rules, while appropriate information must still
          be provided.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>7. Links to external websites</h2>
        <p>
          Boscofuso may contain links to external platforms, including Amazon, Kobo or other stores
          and services. When you follow one of these links, you leave boscofuso.com and any subsequent
          processing is governed by the terms and privacy notices of the external website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Boscofuso does not automatically receive personal data that you may later provide to those
          platforms simply because you reached them through a link on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>8. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Any technical and security data are retained only for as long as necessary for the purposes
          for which they are processed and in accordance with the retention periods applied by the
          relevant technical providers. The website does not maintain a database of registered users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>9. Recipients and international transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Technical data may be processed by providers required for the operation of the website,
          particularly Cloudflare and, for font delivery, Google. These providers may operate through
          globally distributed infrastructure, including outside the European Economic Area, and
          apply their own compliance mechanisms and safeguards for international transfers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>10. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Where provided by applicable law, you may request access to your personal data,
          rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, objection and data portability, and you
          may lodge a complaint with the competent supervisory authority.
        </p>
        <p>
          Requests may be sent to the privacy contact indicated in section 1.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-page__section">
        <h2>11. Changes to this notice</h2>
        <p>
          This page may be updated when the website features, technical services or applicable law
          change. The date of the latest revision is shown at the top of this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a class="privacy-page__back" href="/en/">← Back to the website</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
  if ("scrollRestoration" in history) {
    history.scrollRestoration = "manual";
  }

  const goToTop = () => {
    window.scrollTo(0, 0);
  };

  goToTop();
  window.addEventListener("pageshow", goToTop);
</script>
